From: Aurel Nymvale <Gero3977@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] map: add joan LSM6DSE and fix ICM40604 orientation keys

LG V30 sensor registry data uses group 1001 with keys 720-722 for
LSM6DSE orientation. It also uses group 1010 with keys 800-802 for
ICM40604, while the existing map accidentally starts that group at key
700.

Signed-off-by: Lance <Gero3977@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: Hermes-Agent:openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol
---
diff --git a/map.c b/map.c
index 2dfe34e..4012f6c 100644
--- a/map.c
+++ b/map.c
@@ -33,19 +33,27 @@ const struct group groups[] = {
 	{ 1000,
 		{
 			{ 700, 1 },
 			{ 701, 1 },
 			{ 702, 1 },
 			{ /* sentinel */ }
 		},
 	},
+	{ 1001,
+		{
+			{ 720, 1 },
+			{ 721, 1 },
+			{ 722, 1 },
+			{ /* sentinel */ }
+		},
+	},
 	{ 1010,
 		{
-			{ 700, 1 },
+			{ 800, 1 },
 			{ 801, 1 },
 			{ 802, 1 },
 			{ /* sentinel */ }
 		},
 	},
 	{ 1020,
 		{
 			{ 900, 1 },
